Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "UrbanStreetDrivingWithLaneIntrusion" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :BehaviorAnomaly ;
    :hasActor :vehicle1, :vehicle2, :vehicle3 ;
    :hasObstacle :roadObject1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2, :risk3 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 .

:vehicle1 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Red vehicle in right lane, partially blocking" .
:vehicle2 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Green vehicle in right lane, moving forward" .
:vehicle3 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "White vehicle in right lane, moving forward" .
:roadObject1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "White lane markings and road surface" .

:weather1 a :ClearCondition ;
    :description "Clear weather, daytime" .

:risk1 a :LaneIntrusionRisk ;
    :description "Red vehicle partially occupying left lane" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 ;
    :confidenceScore "0.75"^^xsd:float .

:risk2 a :RearEndCollisionRisk ;
    :description "Potential rear-end collision risk due to stopped or slow-moving vehicles" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 ;
    :confidenceScore "0.60"^^xsd:float .

:risk3 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "Occlusion risk due to vehicles blocking view of further traffic" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev3 ;
    :confidenceScore "0.55"^^xsd:float .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.60"^^xsd:float .

:sev3 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.55"^^xsd:float .
```

Identified Risks for each risk class:

**Risk 1:**
Description: Red vehicle partially occupying left lane, potentially causing lane intrusion.
Severity Score: 0.75

